cube/swiss/source/devices/memcard/deviceHandler-CARD.h  declares that mount count (card_mount_count)
cube/swiss/source/devices/smb/deviceHandler-SMB.c  retains TinySMB (-ltinysmb) rather than upstream's libsmb2 replacement
cube/swiss/source/bba.c                    startup update probes can bring up an outbound-only interface; when ordinary network services are requested, its thread starts Sync Clock (Settings › Network, gui/time_sync.c), which sets the clock from an NTP server on a thread of its own; init_network() waits for it, so a network device never has the clock stepped under its timeouts
cube/swiss/source/gcm.c                    every walk of a file table stays inside it (fst_entries, fst_name): a damaged image cannot crash the Library, a launch or a disc opened as a folder
cube/swiss/source/devices/filemeta.c       evicted metadata returns to meta_mspace, eviction stops if every entry is in view, 7-bit ASCII banner text skips uchardet/iconv, fallback pixels use a shared array declaration, TGC metadata populates diskId, and banner detection uses the SDK's pre-installed libuchardet rather than uchardet-lite
